ROLLERCONFIG may contain a `,crc:` field.\r\nThis makes the current parsing logic rejecting the mapping entry, if and only if the CRC does not start with an a or b (as the crc: is assumed to be a button function label).\r\n\r\nThe second change is just a typo in the error message.\r\n\r\n## Additional Info\r\n\r\nAlso reproducable with the 3.6.x branch, I did not check the 2.x and 1.x branches.\r\nIt does not happen with the community driven GamecontrollerDB, as it does not contain that CRC field by design.\r\nI came across this as I tried to utilize [Arcade DT](https://github.com/gemba/arcade-dt) with Godot. There you can also find sample mappings.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","description":"","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://gith